  <section class="section shell">
    <div class="prose" style="max-width: 42rem">
      <p>I care about clear thinking, reliable implementation, and the small decisions that help software age well.</p>
      <p>This site is a long-term home for selected work, technical notes, and interests that may not fit neatly anywhere else. It is intentionally sparse today and designed to become more useful over time.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
